---
import { pilotMailto } from '../data/site';
---
<section class="cta-section" id="pilot">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cta-card">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">The pilot</p>
        <h2>Six weeks on a narrow scope of your firm.</h2>
        <p class="cta-question">
          The question to answer at the end is simple: is the captured memory worth extending
          to the rest of the firm?
        </p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn btn-light btn-lg" href={pilotMailto}>Discuss a pilot</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost-light btn-lg" href="/resources/pilot">How the pilot works</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <ol class="weeks">
        <li><span>Weeks 1–2</span>Write the first fifteen rules, starting from three questions put to your experts.</li>
        <li><span>Weeks 3–6</span>Apply them to your own engagements.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
